sequenceDiagram
    participant S3C as S3 Curated Zone<br/>ods-curated-{env}
    participant EB as AWS EventBridge<br/>ods-curated-file-rule-{env}
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>ods.pipeline.file_state
    participant DAG as Airflow DAG
    participant CFG as S3 Config<br/>ods-config-{env}
    participant GLUE as Glue Job<br/>(see detail diagram)
    participant KAFKA as MSK Topic<br/>ods.{domain}.{dataset}
    participant CAT as Glue Data Catalog<br/>ods_{domain}
    participant CRAWLER as Glue Crawler<br/>ods-{dataset}-crawler
    participant AUDIT as MSK Audit Topic<br/>ods.pipeline.audit
    participant DLQ as S3 DLQ<br/>ods-dlq-{env}

    Note over S3C,PG: Phase 1 · Detect & Guard
    S3C->>EB: ❶ Object Created event (new Parquet file)
    EB->>DAG: ❷ Trigger MWAA DAG (file path from event)
    DAG->>PG: ❸ Check file state (idempotency guard)
    alt Already processed
        PG-->>DAG: status=completed → skip
    else New file
        PG-->>DAG: status=new → proceed
    end

    Note over DAG,CFG: Phase 2 · Orchestrate
    DAG->>CFG: ❹ Load config — resolve pinned S3 version ID
    CFG-->>DAG: topic · key fields · schema ID · DQ rules ref
    DAG->>PG: ❺ Set file state → processing

    Note over DAG,KAFKA: Phase 3 · Glue Processing (schema · DQ · publish — see detail diagram)
    DAG->>GLUE: ❻ Trigger Glue job (config ref + pinned S3 version ID)
    GLUE->>S3C: ❼ Read Parquet file → capture row count (e.g. 10,000 rows)
    alt Job failed
        Note over GLUE,DLQ: ❽ Failure reasons (see detail diagram):<br/>a) Schema incompatible — file routed to DLQ<br/>b) DQ hard block — failing records routed to DLQ<br/>c) Count mismatch — Kafka offset delta ≠ source row count → undelivered records to DLQ
        GLUE-->>DLQ: Failed records routed to DLQ with reason + metadata
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job failed
        DAG->>PG: Set file state → failed
        DAG->>AUDIT: ❾ Emit audit event (status=failed · reason · dataset)
    else Job succeeded
        GLUE-->>KAFKA: Records published (all 10,000 rows confirmed)
        GLUE-->>DAG: Job completed
    end

    Note over DAG,AUDIT: Phase 4 · Post-Publish
    DAG->>PG: ❿ Set file state → completed
    DAG->>CAT: ⓫ Register dataset in Glue Data Catalog
    DAG->>CRAWLER: ⓬ Trigger Glue Crawler (async · no wait)
    DAG->>AUDIT: ⓭ Emit audit event (status=success · record_count · schema_version · topic)
